{"id":"befreit","lemma":"befreit","pos":"adj","rank":2018,"glosses":["freed from something, liberated"],"ipa":"/bəˈfʁaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/De-befreit.ogg/De-befreit.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Befreit die Tiere aus den Käfigen!","en":"Free the animals from their cages.","words":[null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"animal","l":"Tier"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"cage","l":"Käfig"}]},{"text":"Er sagte, sie wollten kämpfen, bis jeder Schwarze befreit sei.","en":"He said they wanted to fight until every black man was free.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"to fight, to struggle"},{"g":"until, to, through"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"a black object or being","l":"Schwarzer"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Tom hat die Geiseln befreit.","en":"Tom freed the hostages.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759423","words":[null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hostage","l":"Geisel"},null]},{"text":"Befreit euch von eurem Haß!","en":"Let go of your hate.","words":[null,{"g":"you (pl.)","l":"ihr"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"your","l":"euer"},null]}]}